      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "## Pilot 全链路总览\n建议先执行 `make e2e`，再按这个顺序查看：\n1. 用户发起 `/api/v1/chat` 或 `/multi-agent`\n2. Evidence∥Knowledge 并行取证并构建 provenance graph\n3. Epistemic gate 决定 accept / replan / abstain\n4. Redis 保存短期上下文，MySQL 保存会话历史\n5. Elasticsearch 收到运行日志，Prometheus 抓取 `/metrics`\n6. Jaeger 收集 `invoke_agent` / `plan` / `chat` / `execute_tool` Trace\n\nAgent 指标：`pilot_agent_runs_total`、`pilot_agent_evidence_confidence`、`pilot_agent_replans_total`。",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "12.4.0",
      "title": "总览说明",
      "type": "text"
    },
